StarDist web application
Copyright 2026 Neurodesk contributors

src/stardist.js ports, function by function, the 2D post-processing of StarDist
0.9.1 (https://github.com/stardist/stardist: _predict_sparse_generator,
c_non_max_suppression_inds, polygons_to_label) and the normalization and tiling
of CSBDeep 0.8.1 (https://github.com/CSBDeep/CSBDeep: normalize, Tiling). Both
are Copyright (c) 2018-2024, Uwe Schmidt, Martin Weigert, under the BSD 3-Clause
licence (LICENSE).

The model, stardist-2d-versatile-fluo.onnx, is StarDist's pretrained
2D_versatile_fluo model (https://github.com/stardist/stardist-models, release
v0.1, python_2D_versatile_fluo.zip), converted to ONNX by
validation/convert_model.py. Copyright (c) 2018-2024, Uwe Schmidt, Martin
Weigert, under the BSD 3-Clause licence (LICENSE).

The bundled clipper-lib 6.4.2 (https://sourceforge.net/projects/jsclipper/), a
JavaScript port of Angus Johnson's Clipper, is Copyright Angus Johnson 2010-2017
and is distributed under the Boost Software License 1.0, reproduced below. It
includes Tom Wu's BigInteger (jsbn), Copyright (c) 2005-2009 Tom Wu, under the
licence at http://www-cs-students.stanford.edu/~tjw/jsbn/LICENSE.

